                                      "text": [
                                        "Mature Silence",
                                        "Nib's first draft\ncalled the lodge\nsilence mature.\nHis revision",
                                        "calls it a symptom\nof the idle pump.\nBoth drafts remain\non display.",
                                        "The little\nembarrassment\nhelps buyers see\nwhat changed. Nib\nsays a",
